ed-pregnant-women-from-protection)772 0 R(the-rule-of-lenity-requires-construction-of-the-statute-in-favor-of-the-accused)778 0 R(the-states-statutory-interpretation-fails-to-consider-statutory-terms-as-written)771 0 R]>>>>>>
